Voice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"satisfies ","type":"text"},{"code":"success","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", without calling ","type":"text"},{"code":"successors","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), and its cost; ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" when the reachable space","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is finite and holds no goal. On an infinite space with no reachable goal it does not return.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"A goal is recognized when it is settled, so the distance is the shortest even when step costs","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"depend on both ends of the step. Among equal-cost paths, which one is returned is unspecified.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Inside an extension of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DirectedGraph"},{"text":", the methods of the same name hide this function; call it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"as ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ShortestPaths.dijkstraShortestPath(from:cutoff:successors:success:)"},{"text":" there.","type":"text"}]},{"name":"Precondition","type":"aside","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every examined cost is at least "},{"code":".zero","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and not NaN (a cost is examined, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"checked, before the cutoff drops its step); "},{"code":"cutoff","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is not NaN; every sum fits in "},{"code":"W","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/shortestpaths\/dijkstrashortestpath(from:cutoff:successors:success:)"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths\/dijkstraShortestPath(from:cutoff:successors:success:)"},"kind":"